## Autoregistro de cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "role": "CLIENT",
    "name": "Laura Perez",
    "email": "laura@correo.com",
    "phone": "61111111",
    "password": "toplevelsecret",
    "age": 28,
    "sex": "FEMENINO",
    "locationName": "Sede Vedado"
}

